  :help/title    "Bolau-kastik"
  :help/q-header   "Ra nam-tor ulidar-zul?"
  :help/a-header   "Wuhkuh-zul t'wehk CSV-suklar ma ulidar-zhitlar — id, ahm, shi'khaf — ri dvel. Kwul-tor ish-veh: ri toglau nash-zul, heh kupi nam-tor svi'kanok suk t'dungau."
  :help/q-quoted   "Ma wuh cell t'nash-veh vel-zul. Nam-tor ish rish?"
  :help/a-quoted   "Rai. Kup ma vel-zulanlar wuh dvel svi'aushfamaya, heh nash-jan-tol pola pehl-zul wuhkuhik. Fna'toglau t'zulanlar — fai-tor wehk jan-tolar — kal-tor pehkaya heh sasarlah rishan. Rihagik."
  :help/q-damaged  "Poprah po-var-tor 'op zulanlar nem-tor?"
  :help/a-damaged  "Ri pab-tor motlh dvunel — zul k'wehk-veh svep-'aylar do wuhkuh-zul, il aushfamaya svi'ri-shid. Ri sanoi il stau: nem-zulanlar sarlah rap-veling, vaj ri glazhau du kwon-sum."
  :help/q-encoding "Ra nam-tor zhit-shid?"
  :help/a-encoding "Nam-tor uzh-feim t'zhitanlar na'suk. Glantokau ish-veh na'du heh motlh ri bolau saven. Wuhkuh-vel t'rishan: aushfa-zhitanlar rifainu — na'wilat nam-tor dvel svi'Advanced."
  :help/q-excel    "Poprah stariben pa'1.048.576 zulanlar?"
  :help/a-excel    "Nam-tor weh-lo' zulanlar kup Excel pehkau svi'wuh sheet. Vesht-vellar pehk na'65.536. Klachek suk to'ovau — ri pehkau Excel ish-veh. Ish nam-tor motlh dvun na'pehkaya."
  :help/q-replace  "Ra tor-tor na'suklar fa'wilat svi'folder?"
  :help/a-replace  "Rai-vel, klee du ki'dungau. Fa'ki'kital, glantokau folder na'suklar k'rap-ahmlar. Kupi glazhau du tetlh heh dvel — kupi kital svi'vath wilat. Nam-tor logical."
  :help/q-cleave   "Poprah ahm CSV Cleaver?"
  :help/a-cleave   "Cleave — Terrasu-zhit k'dah pilash-yehtilar: pehkau heh klashau. Wuh zhit, dah yehtilar. Nash-wilat tor-tor dah-veh: pehkau jan-tol suk t'du na'pi'krusilar, heh klashau kanok zul na'ka-vellar t'ish — vel-zulanlar, ulidarlar, aushfa-zhitanlar sarlah wuhkuh, rihagik."
